  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-9d76edcc6baf1ba5d60e0ccc",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 自主估计器：选取 M 和 N̄，使状态估计器误差方程与 r 无关。2. 跟踪误差估计器：选取 M 和 N̄，使控制律中仅使用跟踪误差 e=(r-y)。3. 零点配置估计器：选取 M 和 N̄，使整个传递函数的 n 个零点配置在设计者选定的位置。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Autonomous estimator: Select M and N̄ so that the state estimator error equation is independent of r. 2. Tracking-error estimator: Select M and N̄ so that only the tracking error e=(r-y) is used in the control. 3. Zero-assignment estimator: Select M and N̄ so that n zeros of the overall transfer function are assigned at places of the designer's choice.",
